{"seq":3,"slug":"rego-advanced-patterns","title":"Rego 高级模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/opa-rego/rego-advanced-patterns","wordCount":1054,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"rego-高级模式\">Rego 高级模式</h1><p>掌握 Rego 基础语法后，需要进一步了解增量规则、自定义函数、库组织和测试模式等高级特性。这些模式是编写可维护、可测试的生产级策略的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h2 id=\"增量规则-incremental-rules\">增量规则（Incremental Rules）</h2><p>增量规则是 Rego 中最强大的模式之一。它允许同一条规则被多次定义，每次贡献一个或多个值到结果集合中，而非简单的 OR 逻辑。</p>\n<h3 id=\"基础增量规则\">基础增量规则</h3><p>使用 <code>contains</code> 关键字定义增量规则，每条匹配的规则体都向结果集合中添加一个元素。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# 收集所有违规：每条匹配的规则都贡献一个违规消息&#10;violations contains msg if {&#10;    c := input.spec.containers[_]&#10;    contains(c.image, &quot;:latest&quot;)&#10;    msg := sprintf(&quot;[%v] 使用 latest 标签&quot;, [c.name])&#10;}&#10;&#10;violations contains msg if {&#10;    c := input.spec.containers[_]&#10;    not c.resources.limits&#10;    msg := sprintf(&quot;[%v] 缺少资源限制&quot;, [c.name])&#10;}&#10;&#10;violations contains msg if {&#10;    c := input.spec.containers[_]&#10;    c.securityContext.privileged == true&#10;    msg := sprintf(&quot;[%v] 特权容器&quot;, [c.name])&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 收集所有违规：每条匹配的规则都贡献一个违规消息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>violations contains msg if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c := input.spec.containers[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    contains(c.image, \":latest\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    msg := sprintf(\"[%v] 使用 latest 标签\", [c.name])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>violations contains msg if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c := input.spec.containers[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    not c.resources.limits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    msg := sprintf(\"[%v] 缺少资源限制\", [c.name])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>violations contains msg if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c := input.spec.containers[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c.securityContext.privileged == true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    msg := sprintf(\"[%v] 特权容器\", [c.name])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>当三条规则都匹配时，<code>violations</code> 是一个包含三条消息的集合。</p>\n<h3 id=\"增量规则-vs-普通规则\">增量规则 vs 普通规则</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>普通规则（OR）</th>\n<th>增量规则（contains）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>结果类型</td>\n<td>单个值（true/false/字符串）</td>\n<td>集合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>多条定义</td>\n<td>任一匹配即返回真</td>\n<td>所有匹配的元素合并为集合</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型用途</td>\n<td>授权决策（allow/deny）</td>\n<td>违规收集、报告生成</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph &quot;普通规则 OR 逻辑&quot;&#10;        R1[规则 1 匹配] --&gt; OR{任一匹配}&#10;        R2[规则 2 匹配] --&gt; OR&#10;        R3[规则 3 不匹配] --&gt; OR&#10;        OR --&gt; |true| RES[结果: true]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph &quot;增量规则集合合并&quot;&#10;        S1[规则 1 贡献 A] --&gt; UNION[集合合并]&#10;        S2[规则 2 贡献 B] --&gt; UNION&#10;        S3[规则 3 不贡献] --&gt; UNION&#10;        UNION --&gt; SET[&quot;结果: {A, B}&quot;]&#10;    end\">graph TD\n    subgraph \"普通规则 OR 逻辑\"\n        R1[规则 1 匹配] --&gt; OR{任一匹配}\n        R2[规则 2 匹配] --&gt; OR\n        R3[规则 3 不匹配] --&gt; OR\n        OR --&gt; |true| RES[结果: true]\n    end\n    subgraph \"增量规则集合合并\"\n        S1[规则 1 贡献 A] --&gt; UNION[集合合并]\n        S2[规则 2 贡献 B] --&gt; UNION\n        S3[规则 3 不贡献] --&gt; UNION\n        UNION --&gt; SET[\"结果: {A, B}\"]\n    end</pre><h3 id=\"对象增量规则\">对象增量规则</h3><p>增量规则也可以用于对象（键值映射），使用 <code>key -&gt; value</code> 语法。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# 构建容器名到违规列表的映射&#10;container_violations[name] = msgs if {&#10;    c := input.spec.containers[_]&#10;    name := c.name&#10;    msgs := container_check_results(c)&#10;    count(msgs) &gt; 0&#10;}&#10;&#10;container_check_results(c) := m if {&#10;    m := [msg |&#10;        check(c, msg)&#10;    ]&#10;}&#10;&#10;check(c, msg) if {&#10;    contains(c.image, &quot;:latest&quot;)&#10;    msg := &quot;latest 标签&quot;&#10;}&#10;&#10;check(c, msg) if {&#10;    not c.resources.limits&#10;    msg := &quot;缺少资源限制&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 构建容器名到违规列表的映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>container_violations[name] = msgs if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c := input.spec.containers[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name := c.name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    msgs := container_check_results(c)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    count(msgs) > 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>container_check_results(c) := m if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    m := [msg |</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        check(c, msg)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>check(c, msg) if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    contains(c.image, \":latest\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    msg := \"latest 标签\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>check(c, msg) if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    not c.resources.limits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    msg := \"缺少资源限制\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"自定义函数\">自定义函数</h2><p>Rego 支持定义可复用的函数，提高策略代码的可维护性和可读性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"函数定义\">函数定义</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# 定义一个检查容器镜像是否来自受信仓库的函数&#10;is_trusted_image(image) if {&#10;    startswith(image, &quot;registry.example.com/&quot;)&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 定义一个返回值的函数&#10;extract_tag(image) := tag if {&#10;    parts := split(image, &quot;:&quot;)&#10;    count(parts) == 2&#10;    tag := parts[1]&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 定义带 else 分支的函数&#10;resource_category(cpu) := cat if {&#10;    cpu_num := to_number(cpu)&#10;    cpu_num &gt;= 4&#10;    cat := &quot;large&quot;&#10;} else := &quot;medium&quot; if {&#10;    cpu_num &gt;= 2&#10;    cat := &quot;medium&quot;&#10;} else := &quot;small&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 定义一个检查容器镜像是否来自受信仓库的函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>is_trusted_image(image) if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    startswith(image, \"registry.example.com/\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 定义一个返回值的函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>extract_tag(image) := tag if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    parts := split(image, \":\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    count(parts) == 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    tag := parts[1]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 定义带 else 分支的函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>resource_category(cpu) := cat if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    cpu_num := to_number(cpu)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    cpu_num >= 4</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    cat := \"large\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>} else := \"medium\" if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    cpu_num >= 2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    cat := \"medium\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>} else := \"small\"</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"函数的使用场景\">函数的使用场景</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>示例函数</th>\n<th>好处</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>重复逻辑提取</td>\n<td><code>is_trusted_image()</code></td>\n<td>避免代码重复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂计算封装</td>\n<td><code>calculate_cost()</code></td>\n<td>提高可读性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨包共享逻辑</td>\n<td><code>lib.strings.to_snake()</code></td>\n<td>促进代码复用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试友好</td>\n<td>纯函数易于单元测试</td>\n<td>提高测试覆盖率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>函数设计原则：</strong> 好的 Rego 函数应该是纯函数——相同的输入总是产生相同的输出，不依赖外部状态。这使得函数易于测试和推理。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"策略库组织\">策略库组织</h2><p>随着策略数量增长，合理的代码组织结构变得至关重要。</p>\n<h3 id=\"目录结构建议\">目录结构建议</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"policies/&#10;├── lib/                          # 公共库函数&#10;│   ├── strings.rego              # 字符串处理工具&#10;│   ├── kubernetes.rego           # K8s 通用辅助函数&#10;│   └── compliance.rego           # 合规检查工具&#10;├── kubernetes/                   # K8s 准入策略&#10;│   ├── admission.rego            # 准入控制主入口&#10;│   ├── pod_security.rego         # Pod 安全策略&#10;│   ├── resource_limits.rego      # 资源限制策略&#10;│   └── image_trust.rego          # 镜像信任策略&#10;├── terraform/                    # Terraform 策略&#10;│   ├── aws.rego                  # AWS 资源检查&#10;│   └── tagging.rego              # 标签策略&#10;└── tests/                        # 测试文件&#10;    ├── kubernetes/&#10;    │   ├── admission_test.rego&#10;    │   └── testdata/             # 测试输入数据&#10;    └── terraform/\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>policies/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── lib/                          # 公共库函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── strings.rego              # 字符串处理工具</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── kubernetes.rego           # K8s 通用辅助函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── compliance.rego           # 合规检查工具</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── kubernetes/                   # K8s 准入策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── admission.rego            # 准入控制主入口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── pod_security.rego         # Pod 安全策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── resource_limits.rego      # 资源限制策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── image_trust.rego          # 镜像信任策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── terraform/                    # Terraform 策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── aws.rego                  # AWS 资源检查</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── tagging.rego              # 标签策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── tests/                        # 测试文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── kubernetes/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   ├── admission_test.rego</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    │   └── testdata/             # 测试输入数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── terraform/</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"包命名约定\">包命名约定</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# 库函数：以 lib 开头，按功能分类&#10;package lib.kubernetes&#10;package lib.compliance&#10;package lib.strings&#10;&#10;# 具体策略：按执行点和领域分类&#10;package kubernetes.admission.pod_security&#10;package kubernetes.admission.network&#10;package terraform.aws.s3\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 库函数：以 lib 开头，按功能分类</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>package lib.kubernetes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>package lib.compliance</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>package lib.strings</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 具体策略：按执行点和领域分类</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>package kubernetes.admission.pod_security</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>package kubernetes.admission.network</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>package terraform.aws.s3</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"入口模式\">入口模式</h3><p>使用一个主入口文件聚合所有子策略，提供统一的评估接口。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# admission.rego — 准入控制主入口&#10;package kubernetes.admission&#10;&#10;import data.kubernetes.admission.pod_security&#10;import data.kubernetes.admission.resource_limits&#10;import data.kubernetes.admission.image_trust&#10;&#10;# 汇总所有违规&#10;all_violations := violations {&#10;    violations := pod_security.violations | resource_limits.violations | image_trust.violations&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 最终决策&#10;allow if count(all_violations) == 0\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># admission.rego — 准入控制主入口</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>package kubernetes.admission</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import data.kubernetes.admission.pod_security</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import data.kubernetes.admission.resource_limits</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import data.kubernetes.admission.image_trust</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 汇总所有违规</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>all_violations := violations {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    violations := pod_security.violations | resource_limits.violations | image_trust.violations</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 最终决策</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>allow if count(all_violations) == 0</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"测试模式\">测试模式</h2><p>策略代码和应用代码一样需要测试。OPA 内置了测试框架，支持为 Rego 策略编写单元测试。</p>\n<h3 id=\"测试文件结构\">测试文件结构</h3><p>测试文件以 <code>_test.rego</code> 结尾，放在与被测策略相同的包中。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# admission_test.rego&#10;package kubernetes.admission&#10;&#10;import future.keywords.if&#10;&#10;# 测试用例：合法 Pod 应该被允许&#10;test_allow_valid_pod if {&#10;    result := allow with input as {&#10;        &quot;request&quot;: {&#10;            &quot;kind&quot;: {&quot;kind&quot;: &quot;Pod&quot;},&#10;            &quot;operation&quot;: &quot;CREATE&quot;,&#10;            &quot;object&quot;: {&#10;                &quot;spec&quot;: {&#10;                    &quot;containers&quot;: [&#10;                        {&#10;                            &quot;name&quot;: &quot;app&quot;,&#10;                            &quot;image&quot;: &quot;registry.example.com/app:v1.0.0&quot;,&#10;                            &quot;resources&quot;: {&#10;                                &quot;requests&quot;: {&quot;cpu&quot;: &quot;100m&quot;, &quot;memory&quot;: &quot;128Mi&quot;},&#10;                                &quot;limits&quot;: {&quot;cpu&quot;: &quot;500m&quot;, &quot;memory&quot;: &quot;512Mi&quot;}&#10;                            }&#10;                        }&#10;                    ]&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;    result == true&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 测试用例：使用 latest 标签的 Pod 应该被拒绝&#10;test_deny_latest_tag if {&#10;    result := allow with input as {&#10;        &quot;request&quot;: {&#10;            &quot;kind&quot;: {&quot;kind&quot;: &quot;Pod&quot;},&#10;            &quot;operation&quot;: &quot;CREATE&quot;,&#10;            &quot;object&quot;: {&#10;                &quot;spec&quot;: {&#10;                    &quot;containers&quot;: [&#10;                        {&#10;                            &quot;name&quot;: &quot;app&quot;,&#10;                            &quot;image&quot;: &quot;myapp:latest&quot;,&#10;                            &quot;resources&quot;: {&quot;limits&quot;: {&quot;memory&quot;: &quot;256Mi&quot;}}&#10;                        }&#10;                    ]&#10;                }&#10;            }&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;    result == false&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># admission_test.rego</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>package kubernetes.admission</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import future.keywords.if</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 测试用例：合法 Pod 应该被允许</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>test_allow_valid_pod if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result := allow with input as {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"request\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"kind\": {\"kind\": \"Pod\"},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"operation\": \"CREATE\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"object\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                \"spec\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    \"containers\": [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            \"name\": \"app\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            \"image\": \"registry.example.com/app:v1.0.0\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            \"resources\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                \"requests\": {\"cpu\": \"100m\", \"memory\": \"128Mi\"},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                                \"limits\": {\"cpu\": \"500m\", \"memory\": \"512Mi\"}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result == true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 测试用例：使用 latest 标签的 Pod 应该被拒绝</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>test_deny_latest_tag if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result := allow with input as {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        \"request\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"kind\": {\"kind\": \"Pod\"},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"operation\": \"CREATE\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            \"object\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                \"spec\": {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    \"containers\": [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            \"name\": \"app\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            \"image\": \"myapp:latest\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                            \"resources\": {\"limits\": {\"memory\": \"256Mi\"}}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result == false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"测试数据组织\">测试数据组织</h3><p>对于复杂的测试输入，建议将测试数据放在 <code>testdata/</code> 目录中。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"tests/&#10;├── admission_test.rego&#10;└── testdata/&#10;    ├── valid_pod.json&#10;    ├── invalid_latest_tag.json&#10;    ├── invalid_no_limits.json&#10;    └── privileged_container.json\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>tests/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── admission_test.rego</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── testdata/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── valid_pod.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── invalid_latest_tag.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    ├── invalid_no_limits.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    └── privileged_container.json</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在测试中通过 <code>with input as data.testdata.valid_pod</code> 引用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"运行测试\">运行测试</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 运行所有测试&#10;opa test policies/ -v&#10;&#10;# 运行特定包的测试&#10;opa test policies/kubernetes/ -v&#10;&#10;# 生成覆盖率报告&#10;opa test policies/ --coverage --format=json &gt; coverage.json&#10;&#10;# 运行测试并显示详细输出&#10;opa test policies/ --verbose\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 运行所有测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opa</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> policies/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -v</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 运行特定包的测试</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opa</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> policies/kubernetes/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -v</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生成覆盖率报告</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opa</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> policies/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --coverage</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --format=json</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> coverage.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 运行测试并显示详细输出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opa</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> test</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> policies/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --verbose</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"测试最佳实践\">测试最佳实践</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实践</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>每个策略至少 2 个测试</td>\n<td>一个正向（应通过）和一个反向（应拒绝）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试边界条件</td>\n<td>空输入、缺失字段、极端值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试数据与测试逻辑分离</td>\n<td>使用 testdata 目录管理 JSON 输入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试违规消息</td>\n<td>不仅验证 allow/deny，还验证违规信息的正确性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>测试库函数</td>\n<td>为公共库函数编写专门的单元测试</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"性能优化模式\">性能优化模式</h2><p>在策略数量和数据量增长后，需要关注 Rego 评估的性能。</p>\n<h3 id=\"避免重复计算\">避免重复计算</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# 不推荐：同一个容器列表被多次遍历&#10;violations contains msg if {&#10;    c := input.spec.containers[_]&#10;    check_image(c, msg)&#10;}&#10;&#10;violations contains msg if {&#10;    c := input.spec.containers[_]&#10;    check_resources(c, msg)&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 推荐：一次遍历，收集所有检查结果&#10;violations contains msg if {&#10;    c := input.spec.containers[_]&#10;    container_checks(c, msg)&#10;}&#10;&#10;container_checks(c, msg) if { check_image(c, msg) }&#10;container_checks(c, msg) if { check_resources(c, msg) }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 不推荐：同一个容器列表被多次遍历</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>violations contains msg if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c := input.spec.containers[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    check_image(c, msg)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>violations contains msg if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c := input.spec.containers[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    check_resources(c, msg)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 推荐：一次遍历，收集所有检查结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>violations contains msg if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    c := input.spec.containers[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    container_checks(c, msg)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>container_checks(c, msg) if { check_image(c, msg) }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>container_checks(c, msg) if { check_resources(c, msg) }</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"使用索引\">使用索引</h3><p>对于大型数据集，使用对象映射而非数组查找。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# 不推荐：线性遍历查找&#10;user_has_permission if {&#10;    user := data.users[_]&#10;    user.id == input.user_id&#10;    permission := user.permissions[_]&#10;    permission == input.required_permission&#10;}&#10;&#10;# 推荐：使用对象索引直接查找&#10;user_has_permission if {&#10;    user := data.users_by_id[input.user_id]&#10;    permission := user.permissions[_]&#10;    permission == input.required_permission&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 不推荐：线性遍历查找</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>user_has_permission if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    user := data.users[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    user.id == input.user_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    permission := user.permissions[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    permission == input.required_permission</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 推荐：使用对象索引直接查找</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>user_has_permission if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    user := data.users_by_id[input.user_id]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    permission := user.permissions[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    permission == input.required_permission</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"控制评估深度\">控制评估深度</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"# 限制递归深度，防止无限递归&#10;max_depth := 10&#10;&#10;check_nested(obj, depth) if {&#10;    depth &lt; max_depth&#10;    child := obj.children[_]&#10;    check_nested(child, depth + 1)&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 限制递归深度，防止无限递归</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>max_depth := 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>check_nested(obj, depth) if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    depth &#x3C; max_depth</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    child := obj.children[_]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    check_nested(child, depth + 1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"调试技巧\">调试技巧</h2><p>策略开发过程中，有效的调试手段可以大幅提高效率。</p>\n<h3 id=\"opa-eval-交互式测试\">opa eval 交互式测试</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 直接评估一个表达式&#10;opa eval -i input.json -d policies/ &quot;data.kubernetes.admission.allow&quot;&#10;&#10;# 查看所有违规&#10;opa eval -i input.json -d policies/ &quot;data.kubernetes.admission.violations&quot;&#10;&#10;# 格式化输出&#10;opa eval -i input.json -d policies/ &quot;data.kubernetes.admission&quot; --format=pretty\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 直接评估一个表达式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opa</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> eval</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> input.json</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> policies/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"data.kubernetes.admission.allow\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 查看所有违规</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opa</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> eval</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> input.json</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> policies/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"data.kubernetes.admission.violations\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 格式化输出</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opa</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> eval</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> input.json</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> policies/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"data.kubernetes.admission\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --format=pretty</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"print-语句调试\">print 语句调试</h3><p>在 Rego 规则中使用 <code>print()</code> 输出调试信息。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rego\" data-code=\"check_container(c) := msg if {&#10;    print(&quot;检查容器:&quot;, c.name, &quot;镜像:&quot;, c.image)&#10;    contains(c.image, &quot;:latest&quot;)&#10;    msg := &quot;latest 标签&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>check_container(c) := msg if {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    print(\"检查容器:\", c.name, \"镜像:\", c.image)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    contains(c.image, \":latest\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    msg := \"latest 标签\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"trace-分析\">trace 分析</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 生成评估追踪，查看每一步的求值过程&#10;opa eval -i input.json -d policies/ &quot;data.kubernetes.admission.allow&quot; --format=pretty --explain=full\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 生成评估追踪，查看每一步的求值过程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">opa</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> eval</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -i</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> input.json</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -d</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> policies/</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"data.kubernetes.admission.allow\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --format=pretty</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --explain=full</span></span></code></pre></div><p>trace 输出会显示规则评估的完整路径，包括哪些条件匹配成功、哪些失败，是定位策略逻辑问题的有力工具。关于策略测试的更多方法论，参见<a href=\"../pac-operations/policy-testing\">策略测试与验证</a>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((Rego 高级模式))&#10;    增量规则&#10;      contains 关键字&#10;      集合合并&#10;      对象增量&#10;    自定义函数&#10;      纯函数原则&#10;      可复用逻辑&#10;      跨包共享&#10;    策略库组织&#10;      lib 公共库&#10;      按领域分包&#10;      入口模式&#10;    测试模式&#10;      _test.rego&#10;      testdata 目录&#10;      覆盖率报告&#10;    性能优化&#10;      避免重复计算&#10;      对象索引&#10;      控制递归深度&#10;    调试技巧&#10;      opa eval&#10;      print 语句&#10;      trace 分析\">mindmap\n  root((Rego 高级模式))\n    增量规则\n      contains 关键字\n      集合合并\n      对象增量\n    自定义函数\n      纯函数原则\n      可复用逻辑\n      跨包共享\n    策略库组织\n      lib 公共库\n      按领域分包\n      入口模式\n    测试模式\n      _test.rego\n      testdata 目录\n      覆盖率报告\n    性能优化\n      避免重复计算\n      对象索引\n      控制递归深度\n    调试技巧\n      opa eval\n      print 语句\n      trace 分析</pre><ul>\n<li>增量规则通过 <code>contains</code> 关键字实现集合的增量构建，是收集违规信息的核心模式。</li>\n<li>自定义函数遵循纯函数原则，提高策略代码的复用性和可测试性。</li>\n<li>策略库应按 <code>lib/</code> 公共库 + 领域包的方式组织，通过入口文件聚合子策略。</li>\n<li>OPA 内置测试框架支持 <code>_test.rego</code> 测试文件和 <code>testdata/</code> 数据分离，可生成覆盖率报告。</li>\n<li>性能优化的关键是避免重复遍历和使用对象索引替代线性查找。</li>\n<li><code>opa eval</code>、<code>print</code> 语句和 <code>--explain=full</code> trace 是 Rego 调试的三大工具。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Rego 高级模式","id":"rego-高级模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"增量规则（Incremental Rules）","id":"增量规则-incremental-rules"},{"level":3,"text":"基础增量规则","id":"基础增量规则"},{"level":3,"text":"增量规则 vs 普通规则","id":"增量规则-vs-普通规则"},{"level":3,"text":"对象增量规则","id":"对象增量规则"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义函数","id":"自定义函数"},{"level":3,"text":"函数定义","id":"函数定义"},{"level":3,"text":"函数的使用场景","id":"函数的使用场景"},{"level":2,"text":"策略库组织","id":"策略库组织"},{"level":3,"text":"目录结构建议","id":"目录结构建议"},{"level":3,"text":"包命名约定","id":"包命名约定"},{"level":3,"text":"入口模式","id":"入口模式"},{"level":2,"text":"测试模式","id":"测试模式"},{"level":3,"text":"测试文件结构","id":"测试文件结构"},{"level":3,"text":"测试数据组织","id":"测试数据组织"},{"level":3,"text":"运行测试","id":"运行测试"},{"level":3,"text":"测试最佳实践","id":"测试最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"性能优化模式","id":"性能优化模式"},{"level":3,"text":"避免重复计算","id":"避免重复计算"},{"level":3,"text":"使用索引","id":"使用索引"},{"level":3,"text":"控制评估深度","id":"控制评估深度"},{"level":2,"text":"调试技巧","id":"调试技巧"},{"level":3,"text":"opa eval 交互式测试","id":"opa-eval-交互式测试"},{"level":3,"text":"print 语句调试","id":"print-语句调试"},{"level":3,"text":"trace 分析","id":"trace-分析"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Rego 语言基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/opa-rego/rego-language-basics"},"next":{"title":"Kubernetes 准入控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/policy-as-code/pac-platforms/kubernetes-admission"}}